---
title: Run loop — DEPLOY / WATCH / CLASSIFY / RECOVER
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> READY: fleet gate<br/>(all workers report startup complete)
    READY --> DEPLOY

    DEPLOY: DEPLOY
    DEPLOY: tar working tree -> GCS
    DEPLOY: pull on --worker=all
    DEPLOY: relaunch tmux 'train', bake RUN_TAG

    DEPLOY --> WATCH

    WATCH: WATCH
    WATCH: poll worker 0 log, scoped AFTER this RUN_TAG
    WATCH: status markers via tail (never head)
    WATCH: 'Best loss' fetched separately

    WATCH --> WATCH: step lines advancing (T0)
    WATCH --> WATCH: benign stall — compile / val pass / ckpt (T1)

    WATCH --> NEXT: clean exit<br/>'Reached maximum training steps'
    WATCH --> CLASSIFY: dirty exit or timeout
    WATCH --> T3: node preempted / unreachable

    NEXT: NEXT RUN
    NEXT --> DEPLOY: more lines in runs file
    NEXT --> [*]: runs file exhausted

    CLASSIFY: CLASSIFY
    CLASSIFY: match tpu-diagnoser signature table
    CLASSIFY --> DEPLOY: T2 — known fix, not a repeat
    CLASSIFY --> STOP: T4 — unknown, or same class twice

    T3: T3 — qr_watch recycles
    T3: forensics -> quota check -> delete -> resubmit
    T3 --> BOOT: within budget (20)
    T3 --> STOP: budget spent or quota abort

    BOOT: BOOT SELF-HEAL
    BOOT: fetch tarball, resume=auto, same W&B run
    BOOT --> WATCH

    STOP: STOP + notify
    STOP --> [*]
